  "notes": "ABC-Stack G3. Frozen Feature Spec v1 and canonical folds are held fixed while the model family changes from XGBoost to CatBoost. Early stopping uses only the corresponding outer-fold validation partition. The planned 1,000-tree, depth-8 preflight was stopped after 30 minutes without one completed fold; reducing only trees and depth was also insufficient. A compute-bounded CPU run completed fold 0 but was paused to move the official 5-fold execution to RunPod. The official run uses a single RTX 4090 with CatBoost GPU training; the CPU-only rsm bound is removed because CatBoost MultiClass GPU training does not support it. GPU availability is verified by a short smoke test before the clean-commit official run."
